      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ballynaparka House\r\n\r\nSteeped in West Waterford history, this magnificent 19th-century Georgian country estate (circa 4,500 sq. ft. excluding basement) near Aglish offers absolute privacy, historic prestige, and modern comfort in the Blackwater Valley.\r\n\r\nThe Estate:\r\n•\t51 private acres of gardens, woodland, pasture, borders local stream.\r\n•\tAuthentic stone-walled garden perfect for farm-to-table projects.\r\n•\tPrivate driveway cocooned by majestic, mature trees.\r\n\r\nThe Residence:\r\n•\t5 bedrooms & 4 bathrooms, including a principal suite with dual ensuites.\r\n•\tClassic Georgian architecture featuring a two-storey over basement design.\r\n•\tOriginal period features like sash windows, ornate plasterwork, pitch-pine floors and substantial mahogany doors.  Modernised heating with a sustainable wood-fired boiler and automated oil system.\r\n•\tLight-filled reception rooms with exceptional ceiling heights and classic fireplaces.\r\n\r\nThe Location:\r\n•\tComplete rural isolation just minutes from the culinary hub of Dungarvan.\r\n•\tHighly accessible location roughly one hour from Cork International Airport.\r\n\r\n A rare, globally accessible sanctuary ready for its next chapter."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\n\r\nBehind its elegant, symmetrical façade lie beautifully proportioned reception rooms rich in original period detail. The interior boasts exceptional ceiling heights, ornate plasterwork, deep cornicing, original ceiling roses, classic fireplaces, pitch-pine flooring, and substantial mahogany doors. Large, authentic sash windows draw abundant natural light deep into the formal drawing and dining rooms, perfectly framing panoramic views of the surrounding private grounds.\r\n\r\nGround floor measurements:\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\n29’ 5” X 19’\r\n\r\nHall \r\n40’ X 16’ 5”\r\n\r\nDrawing Room   \r\n29’7” x 19’ 8” \r\n\r\nSitting Room  \r\n20’ 6” x 17’ 9” \r\n\r\nDownstairs Toilet\r\n5’ X 3’\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n17’ 11” X 12’\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n16’ X 3’\r\n\r\nWalk in Wardrobe\r\n19’ X 4’\r\n\r\nAn elegant bifurcated staircase leads to the upper floor, hosting five substantial, light-filled bedrooms and four bathrooms. This includes an impressive principal suite complete with two independent ensuite bathrooms.\r\n\r\nBedroom Measurements:\r\n\r\nBedroom w/sink and fireplace\r\n18’ X 17’\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom (Has 2 bathrooms)\r\n19’ 5” X 18’ 11”\r\nBlue bathroom 8’ 2” X 5’ 7” \r\nCream Bathroom 11’ 5” X 8’ 3” \r\n\r\nBedroom / Study  \r\n18’ X 10’\r\n\r\nBedroom with en-suite \r\nEn-suite 10’ X 8’\r\nBedroom 18’ 7” X 18’ 7” \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom   \r\n9’ 9” X 7’ 11”\r\n\r\nBlue Bedroom \r\n14’ X 13’"
      },
